WEBVTT

00:10:29.538 --> 00:10:30.689
tell the truth

00:10:30.713 --> 00:10:33.358
and make revolution irresistible.

00:10:34.157 --> 00:10:35.308
AM: For the wizards --

00:10:35.332 --> 00:10:39.053
(Applause)

00:10:39.639 --> 00:10:43.210
AM: For the wizards
and ways of our defiance,

00:10:44.400 --> 00:10:49.013
love-riot visions of our rising,
risen, raised selves.

00:10:49.329 --> 00:10:51.107
The overcoming grace --

00:10:51.131 --> 00:10:52.955
fires, bitter tongues,

00:10:52.979 --> 00:10:55.718
wise as rickety rocking chairs,

00:10:55.742 --> 00:10:58.463
suffering salt and sand skies.

00:10:58.487 --> 00:11:02.107
Memories unshackled and shining stitches